# The repo subset that goes into the agent's workspace (~/Rig/container on the
# M1): an rsync filter, first match wins, read by sync.sh. Core, the Node path
# to the bridge, the public docs and the root package files. The brief and
# anything else we add to the workspace live in agent/Rig/container/ and are
# laid over this subset by sync.sh.
- .DS_Store
- node_modules/
- dist/
- __pycache__/
- *.pyc
+ /package.json
+ /package-lock.json
+ /.gitignore
+ /packages/
+ /packages/core/***
+ /packages/node-socket/***
+ /docs/
+ /docs/bolt-reference.md
+ /docs/recipes.md
- *
